     1,
     "論壇的各位先進，大家好<div><br></div><div>我最近在跑縱橫面分量迴歸，能找到的套件就是rqpd。</div><div>但這套件中並沒有輸出各分量的95%信賴區間。</div><div>請問: 如何用指令的方法計算呢?  或是有其他的方式呢?</div><div><br></div><div>還請各位多多指教，謝謝</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Kate</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "xT-zpYuhBQAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2020-09-19T15:41:48Z",
   "subject": "Re: 請教: rqpd 套件",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Kate,<div><br></div><div>參考以下之內容:</div><div><br></div><div>1. rqpd 套件已經不再支援 CRAN, 另可考慮 plm 套件.</div><div><br></div><div>2. plm 套件有支援 panel data, 在CRAN 網站中有3個 Vignettes 可以參考</div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/plm/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/plm/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237175042000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0sMyNG_RtaeXVU6D_JxUi4\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/plm/index.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>3. broom 套件可以使用 tidy 轉換 plm 模型並計算 confidence interval, 參考以下R程式範例.</div><div><br></div><div>###<br></div><div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"># plm package: Linear Models for Panel Data</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"># broom package: Convert Statistical Objects into Tidy Tibbles</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#0000ff\">library(plm)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#0000ff\">library(broom)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">data(&quot;Produc&quot;, package = &quot;plm&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">head(Produc, n=3)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"># index包括: individual(本例為州) and time period(本例為年)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">Produc_plm &lt;- plm(formula = log(gsp) ~ log(pcap) + log(pc) + log(emp) + unemp,</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">                  data = Produc,</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">                  index = c(&quot;state&quot;, &quot;year&quot;))</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">Produc_plm</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"># summary(Produc_plm)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">tidy(Produc_plm)</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">tidy(Produc_plm, <a href=\"http://conf.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237175042000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_vkFgodAUoSwZsGWGOHb7\">conf.int</a> = TRUE) # default conf.level = 0.95</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">tidy(Produc_plm, <a href=\"http://conf.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237175042000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_vkFgodAUoSwZsGWGOHb7\">conf.int</a> = TRUE, conf.level = 0.9)</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>###</div><div>參考以下附圖, 信賴區間為 conf.low, conf.high</div><div><br></div><div><img alt=\"broom-panel-data-confidence-interval.png\" width=\"920px\" height=\"785px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/attach/5a18ba5b33fc5/broom-panel-data-confidence-interval.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div><div><br></div><div># end</div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">katep...@gmail.com</a> 在 2020年9月16日 星期三下午3:41:28 [UTC+8] 的信中寫道：<br></div></div>"
    ],
